&HEAD CHID='wall_pressure_heated_box', TITLE='Wall pressure in a sealed, uniformly heated box at rest' /

&MESH IJK=16,4,16, XB=0.0,2.0,0.0,0.5,0.0,2.0 /

&TIME T_END=1.0 /

&MISC SIMULATION_MODE='DNS', NOISE=.FALSE., STRATIFICATION=.FALSE., TMPA=20. /

&PRES SOLVER='UGLMAT' /

&RADI RADIATION=.FALSE. /

&DUMP DT_DEVC=0.1, DT_HRR=0.1, SIG_FIGS=10, SIG_FIGS_EXP=3 /

&SPEC ID='GAS', MW=28.8, VISCOSITY=1.8E-5, CONDUCTIVITY=0.026, SPECIFIC_HEAT=1.0, BACKGROUND=.TRUE. /

&ZONE ID='BOX', XYZ=0.0625,0.25,0.0625 /

&SURF ID='WALLS', ADIABATIC=.TRUE., DEFAULT=.TRUE. /
&SURF ID='OBST BLOCK', ADIABATIC=.TRUE. /
&SURF ID='GEOM BLOCK', ADIABATIC=.TRUE. /

The gas starts at 100 C and is heated uniformly, so it stays at rest with a uniform density while its pressure rises.

&INIT XB=0.0,2.0,0.0,0.5,0.0,2.0, TEMPERATURE=100., HRRPUV=1. /

&OBST XB=0.25,0.75,0.0,0.5,0.75,1.25, SURF_ID='OBST BLOCK' /
&GEOM ID='BLOCK', SURF_ID='GEOM BLOCK', XB=1.25,1.75,-0.1,0.6,0.75,1.25 /

Vertical pressure force on each block and on the walls of the box

&DEVC ID='Fz OBST', QUANTITY='WALL PRESSURE', SURF_ID='OBST BLOCK', SPATIAL_STATISTIC='SURFACE INTEGRAL', FORCE_DIRECTION=0.,0.,1.,
      XB=0.0,2.0,0.0,0.5,0.0,2.0 /
&DEVC ID='Fz GEOM', QUANTITY='WALL PRESSURE', SURF_ID='GEOM BLOCK', SPATIAL_STATISTIC='SURFACE INTEGRAL', FORCE_DIRECTION=0.,0.,1.,
      XB=0.0,2.0,0.0,0.5,0.0,2.0 /
&DEVC ID='Fz box', QUANTITY='WALL PRESSURE', SURF_ID='WALLS', SPATIAL_STATISTIC='SURFACE INTEGRAL', FORCE_DIRECTION=0.,0.,1.,
      XB=0.0,2.0,0.0,0.5,0.0,2.0 /

Pressure on the side wall and in the gas next to it, at the same heights

&DEVC ID='wall 1', QUANTITY='WALL PRESSURE', XYZ=0.0,0.25,0.0625, IOR=1 /
&DEVC ID='wall 2', QUANTITY='WALL PRESSURE', XYZ=0.0,0.25,0.5625, IOR=1 /
&DEVC ID='wall 3', QUANTITY='WALL PRESSURE', XYZ=0.0,0.25,1.0625, IOR=1 /
&DEVC ID='wall 4', QUANTITY='WALL PRESSURE', XYZ=0.0,0.25,1.5625, IOR=1 /
&DEVC ID='wall 5', QUANTITY='WALL PRESSURE', XYZ=0.0,0.25,1.9375, IOR=1 /
&DEVC ID='gas 1', QUANTITY='PRESSURE', XYZ=0.0625,0.25,0.0625 /
&DEVC ID='gas 2', QUANTITY='PRESSURE', XYZ=0.0625,0.25,0.5625 /
&DEVC ID='gas 3', QUANTITY='PRESSURE', XYZ=0.0625,0.25,1.0625 /
&DEVC ID='gas 4', QUANTITY='PRESSURE', XYZ=0.0625,0.25,1.5625 /
&DEVC ID='gas 5', QUANTITY='PRESSURE', XYZ=0.0625,0.25,1.9375 /
&DEVC ID='density', QUANTITY='DENSITY', XYZ=1.0,0.25,0.3125 /
&DEVC ID='velocity', QUANTITY='VELOCITY', SPATIAL_STATISTIC='MAX', XB=0.0,2.0,0.0,0.5,0.0,2.0 /

&TAIL /
